In R,

dim(m) <- c(2,2)

can also be written

m <- get("dim<-", m, c(2,2))

Example:
 > m <- 1:4
 > get("dim<-")(m, c(2,2))
      [,1] [,2]
[1,]    1    3
[2,]    2    4
 >

In fact R is not always making copies because of optimization tricks at 
the C level.

